//    - The message type `'snek-state'` (line 14) must match the hook in snek that calls
//    - `postMessage` (mentioned in comment line 3 but not in this file). Changing it silently
//    - breaks saves.
//    - The message type `'snek-restore'` (line 28) must match the listener hook in snek (mentioned
